# resolution instead of cloning. Each SHA below is the tip of the ref
# that sibling's own repository actually uses (verified with
# `git ls-remote`). These pins are the fallback, not the goal: once this
# repo joins the workspace-lock cross-repo CI, delete the `=<sha>`
# suffixes and let the lock pin them.
